  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the average wrist size is <strong>6.9&nbsp;inches (17.6&nbsp;cm) for men</strong> and <strong>6.1&nbsp;inches (15.5&nbsp;cm) for women</strong>. Most men measure 6.4&ndash;7.5&nbsp;in and most women 5.6&ndash;6.6&nbsp;in.</p></div>

